    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>考前的风景格外令人触动</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>白昼的风，夏夜的歌曲：夏天，歌单，公交车，光影霓虹与日记</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《凤凰花开的路口》牵动毕业季的回忆与想象</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《Mystery of love》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>以七老师的aha moments与日记</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《夜晚的潜水艇》与以七老师的改写创作</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>王小波《黄金时代》《我是哪一种女权主义者》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《未来简史》</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>以七和枕山关于自由和人权的探讨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>社会的大壳子是从哪里来的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么要遵守“规则”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>规则与自由的辩证</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>《上海交通大学生存手册》与精致的利己主义者</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“愚蠢的善良”是否还有存在的意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这个时代 不精致利己 还能活吗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>《人类群星闪耀时》与《未来简史》的推荐</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM: <sufjan stevens:="" mystery="" of="" love=""> Alban Claudin</sufjan></span></blockquote>]]></description>
