  <item>
    <title>VOL.005|做飞鸟——Guided routes, not chains</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66058dd42d9eae5d0aab9e68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66058dd42d9eae5d0aab9e68</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 15:33:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>本期我们将探讨：如何从“人”本身出发，去处理世事、接纳万物。当我们因性别议题而迷茫时，如何识别那些为自己利益站台而拉上整个性别群体的霸权者，如何以平等的姿态、冷静的头脑、以清醒的理智去分析问题。</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>问：到底什么是善良的、平等的、道德的立场？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>答：请一切从人性的良善出发！让“人”成为人，在“女人”之上，先允许女人成为“人”本身。</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a></span><em><strong><span>PART 1 : &nbsp;需要一些过载和忙碌的生活——近期生活复盘</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a></span><em><strong><span>PART 2: &nbsp;对混沌，至纯灵魂的追寻</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>北师大教授网课教学</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>向在一线认真教学的教授老师们表达感谢</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a></span><em><strong><span>PART 3: 从最朴素的平权主义瑞萍近期热点</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>北大首映礼之《坠落的审判》<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3763">62:43</a>以《异见时刻：声名狼藉的金斯伯格》来回应</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4900">81:40</a></span><em><strong><span>PART 4: 《反与正》节选与自洽</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>在这里我们再次感受文字的力量感恩文字在“记录-传输-理解”三方传递下幸运地被不同时空的我们所见也感谢许多作者 愿意针砭时弊 一针见血地戳破现实 &nbsp;&nbsp;让我们这些沉默的大多数也可以外化自己内心的想法 &nbsp;&nbsp;找到共鸣并做出改变</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>更加感谢选择记录声音的自己 去推动自己去思考问题 去阅读让自己在每天数理横向思维里可以放空自己 &nbsp;静下心来垂直思考</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>感谢成长/感谢阅读/感谢智慧的启迪/感谢理想的长存/感谢那些至纯至善的灵魂</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>BGM:<who says=""> Selena Gomez &nbsp;</who></span></strong></em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><em><strong><span>&nbsp;| &nbsp;&lt;她和她和她&gt; 于贞 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5465">91:05</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHR10mgjNnpYQ0bZPLIrDprIykS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6xRbdqQ2xFul7iWHJ0QR7X00gO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fux0Aj5d7jSSzyuzokjO8OExkLsm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlMQMw_no48ZLWG8g4-dJfxsd6-p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnCffebagVafkwR1R8cmrZ7YmwMr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsmMM8fzS4B2Q4ViRfZziWeNid3E.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fve6wf-L3PQj3rFqZEMtRg5cH9ou.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvmdaqWV5BZx14wAbsGD7uUuoEwV.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpDq0qGz5lXxY0cVBsJajJlJ-cVE.m4a" length="90297827" type="audio/mp4"/>
