  <item>
    <title>VOL.004|春日序曲——有风吹过我的背影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f3157e696bd9a8793cfe77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f3157e696bd9a8793cfe77</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 15:19:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><em><strong><span>气温一点点升高，绿意一点点升腾，在无数个夜晚，在无数春日的晴天，哪些书和电影陪伴你我走过一个又一个春天。短暂的春日，以七和枕山又有什么新发现和新变化呢？愿清风或微抚或狂卷或掠过耳畔的时候，你在我身后，捕捉到生命的画卷。</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><em><strong><span>在这里你将听到：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a></span></strong></em><span>“关于季节性人格”——从宏观经济学“季节性失业”偷得的概念</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a></span></strong></em><span>春日运动—北京北四环骑行</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a></span></strong></em><span>骄傲是“我”柔弱的表现</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a></span></strong></em><span>自信心习得与假装</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>情绪平复的方法论</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>变得粗糙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>进入心流状态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>抽离 提纯</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>幻想式想象——使欲望感大于恐惧感</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4184">69:44</a></span></strong></em><strong><span>书籍与影片分享</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《海街日记》——平静之下暗流涌动 兼顾画面感故事性和电影美感以及生命思考</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《另一个，同一个》——respect陈春成的《夜晚的潜水艇》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《在绝望之巅》——用平静诡谲甚至是疯狂去探讨那些生命中沉重的课题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《三块广告牌》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《杀手没有假期》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《绿里奇迹》——治愈系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《修女也疯狂》——治愈系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《肖申克的救赎》——励志系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《朗读者》——《愿你慢慢长大》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>《飞松》陈粒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7554">125:54</a>《再谈记忆（say it again）》盘尼西林</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>风传花信 雨濯春尘</span></strong></em></h2>]]></description>
